  "description": "Jeong-min, who accidentally tore up her classmates’ novel, suddenly found herself in the world of the torn novel after she woke up. For a bookworm like her, both her current situation and the new world she is in are completely incomprehensible. \n\nThough she has no knowledge of the world she is in, her unique fiery personality will make up for it. \n\nThat’s why, no matter what obstacles come’s her way, she will give it her best! \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
